                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "What a cool little addictive game and right up my street.\nI love the old retro classics having been around at the birth of the home computer in the 80's\nThis game has all those ingredients of fast paced, addictive, with a classic feel of Thrust, Dropzone and Blitz all rolled into one and all for just 0.79p.\n\nThe controls are customisable which was great as i opted for the spacebar for bombing rather than the default \" Enter \" key and to top it all i also found the android version so i am not just limited to my PC. ( Link Below )\n\nhttp://jimjamsgames.com/android2.html\n\nGreat little game worth every penny :)",
